<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-26T15:20:35.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:20:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces have advanced in Quneitra while a Syrian road security officer was killed in Daraa and later received an official funeral. Protesters blocked the Damascus-Suwayda road demanding the release of detainees and condemning repeated Israeli incursions. Shooting attacks in northern Syria wounded three civilians, and a foreign minister met Saudi King Hamad, while Damascus hosted the FORTIX 2026 security and safety expo. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBUdVZId0pqUnVoMUs1MVJSQ0NySklTNzlkS3VLNGtramJyd1NrR2VTc1NyR0Zkd3pGZE80NFNIZEp4WHIzc3V6LQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFA2b09yMG1saFVYUTBQeFByUVo2SnJFTzA5QWRLM3lhZC1uREpxdDdpWHczTXhQcFZTc2l1eTJ3QnRsT0tfZUp5cWdabjJIN0NmdGwtcXczZmNXb2l3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQS0drMWk3NmZZRVE5TUNPSktObHFKSlVVY1phTURXZU0zb2ZWQmFMcGlNQVhMc0wtblU1NWNsMnF4eDl5ZnZmTlJYckhLOURYRE1UYUlGWWRaMkVtQ3VQbWVpbXNXdVd0UFBJQm1ZSm9tdGxzcEVCZUVnZXJUSzlUSm1SMURTY3RyZlNtbWNnNXRBTVhIblVyZEM2VWQ4anBLdks1bl9paw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBfcTRCX004WHVLUElXVkk0ZEpFLTRUOXYxLWtDbk9mR3lURTRxaHFSNC1NMGJtY1pVbGYxdFA0MWpPR0VGQ3NqaVFPRzJmQ216T212RHJXMFA3Y2E2SDB4UDMwY3A?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9pdm1SNW5zRDZzdDVBSGxPTFpBclY5MkRBV3U4NUczVXg4M1ZOWm8tQ0NiMHRqOWJuRmRNdndJbmk2alBDTURHag?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNa0V0MF8tQ3NOTUV1NEZHTzZHMFY3Q1poSzFEV1VIVUZ6bUxjZWxieFZhTUxUVTF